      "fTerm": "CEMENTS; CONCRETE; ARTIFICIAL STONE; CERAMICS; REFRACTORIES<b>[4]</b><br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>This class <u>does not cover</u> mechanical features provided for elsewhere, e.g. mechanical working <b>B28</b>, kilns <b>F27</b>.</li></ul>",
