      "ipcCode": "",
      "fTerm": "ORGANIC FERTILISERS NOT COVERED BY SUBCLASSES <b>C05B</b>, <b>C05C</b>, e.g. FERTILISERS FROM WASTE OR REFUSE<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>Processes where the composting step is the characterising feature, or apparatus therefor, are classified in group <b>C05F 17/00</b>.<b>[5]</b></li></ul>",
