      "fTerm": "TREATMENT OR CHEMICAL MODIFICATION OF RUBBERS<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul style=\"\"list-style:none\"\"><li>This subclass <u>covers</u>:<b>[2]</b><ul type=\"\"disc\"\"><li>processes directed to natural rubber or to conjugated diene rubbers;</li><li>processes directed to rubbers in general.</li></ul></li></ul>",
