      "fTerm": "APPARATUS FOR ENZYMOLOGY OR MICROBIOLOGY (installations for fermenting manure <b>A01C 3/02</b>;  preservation of living parts of humans or animals <b>A01N 1/10</b>;  brewing apparatus <b>C12C</b>;  fermentation apparatus for wine <b>C12G</b>;  apparatus for preparing vinegar <b>C12J 1/10</b>)<b>[3]</b><br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>Attention is drawn to Notes (1) to (3) following the title of class <b>C12</b>.<b>[4,6]</b></li><li>In this subclass, it is desirable to add the indexing codes of subclass <b>C12R</b>.</li></ul>",
