      "fTerm": "ENAMELLING OF, OR APPLYING A VITREOUS LAYER TO, METALS<br><br><b><u>Subclass indexes</u></b><br><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">TREATMENT PRIOR TO ENAMELLING</td><td><b>1/00</b>, <b>3/00</b></td></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">ENAMELLING</td><td><b>5/00-11/00</b></td></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">AFTER-TREATMENT</td><td><b>13/00</b>, <b>15/00</b>, <b>17/00</b></td></p></tr></table>",
