      "fTerm": "PROCESSES FOR THE ELECTROLYTIC OR ELECTROPHORETIC PRODUCTION OF COATINGS; ELECTROFORMING (manufacturing printed circuits by metal deposition <b>H05K 3/18</b>); JOINING WORKPIECES BY ELECTROLYSIS; APPARATUS THEREFOR (anodic or cathodic protection <b>C23F 13/00</b>; single-crystal growth <b>C30B</b>)<b>[2,6]</b><br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>Coating with two or more superposed coatings obtained by combination of methods provided for in this subclass and in subclass <b>C23C</b> is classified in group <b>C23C 28/00</b>.<b>[2012.01]</b></li></ul>",
