      "ja": "環系または縮合環系をすでに含有する化合物を出発化合物とする製造，たとえば環の脱水素処理，置換基の導入，脱離または変成によるもの［６］",
      "en": "maufacturing where starting compounds are compounds already containing the ring or condensed ring systems, e.g. by dehydrogenation of the ring, by introduction, elimination or modification of substituents [6]",
